"the web. A dictionary for crosswords is available from <a href=\"http://www."
"quinapalus.com/xwfaq.html\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:"
"#0057ae;\">http://www.quinapalus.com/xwfaq.html</span></a>, look for the "
"UKACD link. The dictionaries must be plain text files with one word in each "
"line.</p></body></html>"
